    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb557e4f49fa8a25e05c51fa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既然决定了，就把你们一网打尽吧。\n那我开始数咯。一～二～～",
      "source_fingerprint": "9434fa8632104bd8a1d1925534af230afddfe4d9c9a3fbf5d86fa3dea8c19753",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/80/1039/storytimeline_801039002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a741256c5793af565159abdf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "数到十之后，她猛烈地四处追赶孩子们，\n一个接一个地抓到了所有人！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af8fcdea61d2501d1c53eea5bd3ae37af7c0eae1a883cd36d4167ee0b0a8c85f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/80/1039/storytimeline_801039002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d02600e54872d585a6fa05f2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我试着提议新增“就算没摸到，\n踩到影子也算赢”的规则。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f0735c38385b73e0a6529be605c759c897dbe2faf634c72dd4ccda64727134d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
