    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0dd62a2af1c13abbe72e41f9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哎呀……这份至少要碰到公主影子的\n品格！真是太棒了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c356bc4f6adf836e0449d3b708628f33082fa7b062615d8cc0a57c2ad8803fe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
