    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:857610f7757185abb113d180",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她说完之后就飒爽地起跑，且似乎为了\n不被踩到影子，而采取活用树荫等战术。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d56e471eb69f324587731b67c5521521c22cb1803c45222c02cfcef5baf60faa",
